# Options for moonstt-dictate (see `moonstt-dictate -h`).
#   -k CODE   talk key (default 172 = KEY_HOMEPAGE; needs the kernel to report it)
#   -g N      microphone capture gain 0-7 (default 7)
#   -o MODE   typing backend: auto | uinput | tty (default auto)
#   -n        do not append a trailing space
